abstract: "<h2>Breaking changes</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>ImagingSpec</code> now requires\
  \ aperture diameter <code>d</code> to be explicitly set.</li>\n<li><code>simulate_phases</code>\
  \ and <code>SavedPhases</code> now accept aperture diameter<code>d</code> as an\
  \ <strong>optional</strong> positional argument. <code>grid_step=\u2026</code> is\
  \ also available, overriding the <code>d</code> argument. When none are provided,\
  \ defaults to <code>grid_step = 1</code>.</li>\n<li>All atmosphere models now store\
  \ <code>base_wavelength</code>to ensure correct scaling for multi-wavelength imaging.\
  \ Default base wavelength is 550 nm.</li>\n<li><code>base_wavelength</code> field\
  \ was removed from <code>FilterSpec</code>. The convenience constructor preserved\
  \ the same signature.</li>\n<li>Deprecated methods for <code>ImagingSpec</code>\
  \ and <code>HDF5File</code> are removed.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>New features</h2>\n<ul>\n\
  <li>Now the correct backend is selected by <code>MultiThreaded([adapter, nworkers])</code></li>\n\
  <li>Harding interpolation now runs in parallel across CPU threads, reducing phase-generation\
  \ time at large <code>N</code>.</li>\n<li><code>SingleLayer</code> and <code>SavedPhases</code>\
  \ accept <code>base_wavelength</code> keyword (nm) for per-atmosphere reference\
  \ wavelength control.</li>\n<li><code>SavedPhases</code> accepts optional positional\
  \ <code>d</code> argument and <code>grid_step</code> keyword, enabling correct broadband\
  \ replay of saved tasets.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Fixes</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed broadband\
  \ phase scaling sign: wavelength ratio was inverted, producing wrong PSF width scaling\
  \ across filter channels.</li>\n<li>Numerous performance improvements.</li>\n</ul>\n\
  <h2>Internal changes</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>OpticalBuffers</code> no longer allocates\
  \ along the wavelength dimension; each wavelength channel is processed sequentially\
  \ through the same buffer, reducing peak memory usage for broadband simulations.</li>\n\
  <li><code>ImgBufSerial</code> was removed; the single-threaded functionality is\
  \ handled by <code>ImgBufParallel</code>, which is renamed to <code>SimulationBuffers</code></li>\n\
  <li>Internal field names unified: <code>buffer</code>/<code>out_buffer</code> \u2192\
  \ <code>out_array</code> across all phase-computing structs; <code>base</code> \u2192\
  \ <code>phs_buf</code> in <code>HardingInterpolator</code>.</li>\n<li><code>ImagingSpec</code>\
  \ stores <code>grid_step</code> directly; removed <code>ap_step</code> helper \u2014\
  \ use <code>img_spec.grid_step</code>.</li>\n<li><code>ChunkSplitters.jl</code>\
  \ added as a direct dependency for better load balancing</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full\
  \ Changelog</strong>: https://github.com/aryavorskiy/AtmosphericTurbulenceSimulator.jl/compare/v0.4.1...v0.5.0</p>"
